[[File:Madjick.png|thumb|169x169px|Post Alpha 2.7]]

Madjick started out with 7/5 for 8G. '''Alpha 2.7''' buffed it by giving it -3/-2 and -3G, leaving it at 4/3 for 5G. This stayed that way for a long time, until '''Beta 19.0''' buffed its HP to 4 and '''Beta 48.0''' buffed its cost to 4G.
[[File:Madjick (Beta 19.0).png|thumb|171x171px|Beta 19.0]]

